Third-party code under vendor/ and third_party/ keeps its own copyright and
license, recorded beside it.

A ze binary carries its own record of the third-party works compiled into
it: "ze thanks" lists them, with the version, license and copyright holder
of each, and "ze thanks licence" prints their license and notice texts. The
Dependencies page, https://ze-software.net/reference/dependencies/, lists the
same works and the development tools Ze is built with. Both are generated
from website/data/dependencies.json, as
docs/architecture/third-party-credits.md describes.
